Project: Multiplication Table

Print an N×N multiplication table to the terminal.

Requirements:

Hardcode int n = 10; at the top — changing that one variable should change the whole table
Each number must be right-aligned so columns line up cleanly
Rows and columns both go from 1 to n

Expected output for n = 5:

  1  2  3  4  5
  2  4  6  8 10
  3  6  9 12 15
  4  8 12 16 20
  5 10 15 20 25

What you'll practice:

Nested for loops
printf format widths (%3d etc.)
How two loop variables interact to produce a value

Rules:

No functions, no arrays — just loops and printf
Everything in main()
